<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">While the standard WhatsApp Business app is designed for solo users, a CRM is built for scaling revenue. And the secret behind this is the </span><a href="/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span style="font-weight: 400;">WhatsApp Business API</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">. It is Meta’s official gateway, offering multi-agent access, advanced automation, bulk broadcasting, and deep integration. </span></p>
